<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - S. Barney starts DLJ.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - S. Barney starts DLJ.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney has started coverage of Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Inc with a neutral recommendation, a market source said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock opened down 1/4 to 34-5/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
